# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored). Both this key and the Supabase pair below
# are required — there is no mocked fallback.
#
# Every user's generation calls go through this one key (no per-user
# bring-your-own-key path). Vite inlines this value into the client bundle:
# anyone who loads the build can read it. Proxy the call through a server
# instead if that's not acceptable for your deployment.
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Supabase for real accounts + cross-device deck sync. The anon key is safe to
# ship in the bundle (it's locked down by Row Level Security); the URL is
# public.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
